# Curate Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Curate.

Curate is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token smart contract security reference covering XCUR token contracts across Ethereum and BNB Chain.

## Audit Information

Project: Curate  
Audit type: Token smart contract audit and certificates  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

